OL,3,GNEWSARoadmap in place for carnival
OL,4,Areturn, say organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of a 40-year-old street
OL,7,Fcarnival say they have a "roadmap" for
OL,8,Fits return, following a two-year hiatus
OL,9,Fcaused by finance issues.
OL,11,FOxford's Cowley Road Carnival has only
OL,12,Fhappened once since the Covid pandemic
OL,13,Fin 2024, with the previous organisers
OL,14,Fstepping down earlier this year.
OL,16,FRosie Jacobs, the new chair of Cowley
OL,17,FRoad Works, the registered charity that
OL,18,Fruns it, and says plans are in place
OL,19,Ffor it to return on 4 July 2027.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
