OL,3,GNEWSARoadmap in place for carnival
OL,4,Areturn, say organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the new committee was "working
OL,7,Freally, really hard behind the scenes
OL,8,Fto make sure that both the charity and
OL,9,Fthe future of Carnival are
OL,10,Fsustainable".
